msgid "![双视频自检的预期画面：左侧 Cat，右侧 Sunset，右栏已开启 Video mode](../media/input-window.png)"
msgstr "![Expected video check: Cat on the left, Sunset on the right, and Video mode enabled in the sidebar](../media/input-window.png)"

#: ../../resources/install.md:1
msgid "下载与安装"
msgstr "Download and install"

#: ../../resources/install.md:3
msgid "下载适合当前系统的桌面包"
msgstr "Download a desktop bundle for your system"

#: ../../resources/install.md:5
msgid ""
"先在 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/releases) 核对目标版本的附件。开发者也可以从 "
"**Desktop packages** 工作流取得对应提交的构建产物。选择与系统和处理器匹配的包；只有源码附件时，请按下节安装。"
msgstr ""
"Check the assets for your version on [GitHub "
"Releases](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/releases). Developers can also download "
"artifacts for a specific commit from the **Desktop packages** workflow. Match the operating "
"system and processor. If only source archives are available, follow the next section."

#: ../../resources/install.md:7
msgid "完整解压软件包并进入 MulimgViewer 目录。Windows 双击 `MulimgViewer.exe`，Linux 和 macOS 在图形桌面的终端执行 `./MulimgViewer`。移动软件时请保留整个目录，包括其中的依赖文件。"
msgstr "Extract the whole archive and open the MulimgViewer directory. On Windows, double-click `MulimgViewer.exe`. On Linux and macOS, run `./MulimgViewer` in a graphical session. Keep the entire directory together when moving the application."

#: ../../resources/install.md:9
msgid "离线包自带 Python、wxPython、FFmpeg 和 FFprobe。可在该目录下运行 `.\\MulimgViewer.exe --self-check`（Windows PowerShell）或 `./MulimgViewer --self-check`（Linux、macOS）验证窗口、视频解码、内置算法以及 PNG、PDF 和 Excel 导出。"
msgstr "The archive includes Python, wxPython, FFmpeg, and FFprobe. From that directory, run `.\\MulimgViewer.exe --self-check` in Windows PowerShell or `./MulimgViewer --self-check` on Linux and macOS to verify the window, video decoding, bundled algorithms, and PNG, PDF, and Excel export."

#: ../../resources/install.md:11
msgid "运行当前源码版"
msgstr "Run from source"

msgid "对于 `.tar.xz` 包，在空目录中执行 `tar -xf 软件包路径` 即可解压。"
msgstr "For a `.tar.xz` package, run `tar -xf ARCHIVE` in an empty directory."

#: ../../resources/install.md:13
msgid "以下命令适用于 Windows、Linux 和 macOS。先安装 Git 和 Conda，在终端（Windows 可用 Anaconda Prompt）执行："
msgstr ""
"On Windows, Linux, or macOS, install Git and Conda first. Run the following commands in a "
"terminal (Anaconda Prompt also works on Windows)."

#: ../../resources/install.md:24
msgid ""
"已有仓库时，从项目根目录的第三条命令开始；已有可用环境时，从激活环境开始。`environment.yml` 指定 Python 3.11，由 conda-forge 安装 "
"wxPython、FFmpeg 和 PyAV。以后启动只需激活同一环境，在仓库根目录执行最后一条命令。"
msgstr ""
"If you already have the repository, start with the third command in its root directory. If you "
"already have a working environment, start with activation. The environment.yml file specifies "
"Python 3.11 and installs wxPython, FFmpeg, and PyAV from conda-forge. On subsequent launches, "
"activate the same environment and run the final command from the repository root."

#: ../../resources/install.md:26
msgid "验证安装"
msgstr "Verify the installation"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "检查"
msgstr "Check"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "怎么做"
msgstr "What to do"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "应该看到什么"
msgstr "Expected result"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "图形界面"
msgstr "Graphical interface"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "启动程序，选择 Sequential，打开 `auto_test_scripts/assets/images/source_001`"
msgstr "Start the application, select Sequential, and open `auto_test_scripts/assets/images/source_001`."

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "能显示图像并翻页"
msgstr "Images appear and you can turn the page."

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "视频工具"
msgstr "Video tools"

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "运行 `python tools/check_video_tools.py`"
msgstr "Run `python tools/check_video_tools.py`."

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "列出当前解释器、FFmpeg 和 FFprobe 的路径，两个程序均可执行"
msgstr "The script lists the active interpreter and the paths to FFmpeg and FFprobe. Both tools can run."

#: ../../resources/install.md
msgid "多视频播放"
msgstr "Parallel video playback"

#: ../../resources/install.md:34
msgid ""
"如果提示找不到 FFmpeg 或 FFprobe，在当前环境执行 `conda install -c conda-forge ffmpeg`，再运行检测脚本。在 IDE "
"中调试时，选择检测脚本输出的同一个 Python 解释器。使用自行安装的工具时，可用环境变量 `FFMPEG_BINARY`、`FFPROBE_BINARY` 分别指定两个可执行文件的完整路径。"
msgstr ""
"If FFmpeg or FFprobe is missing, run `conda install -c conda-forge ffmpeg` in the active "
"environment and run the check again. In an IDE, select the interpreter reported by the script. "
"For separately installed tools, set `FFMPEG_BINARY` and `FFPROBE_BINARY` to the full paths of the"
" respective executables."

#: ../../resources/install.md:36
msgid ""
"如果 Linux 上安装 wxPython 时提示缺少 GTK，先确认已用仓库的 Conda 环境安装原生依赖。macOS 如提示 wxPython 需要框架启动器，可在该环境安装 `conda"
" install -c conda-forge python.app`，然后用 `pythonw MulimgViewer.py` 启动。"
msgstr ""
"If wxPython installation on Linux reports missing GTK libraries, check that you installed native "
"dependencies with the repository’s Conda environment. If macOS requests a framework launcher, "
"install it with `conda install -c conda-forge python.app` and launch with `pythonw "
"MulimgViewer.py`."

msgid "按[双视频示例](usage.md)打开 Cat 和 Sunset，翻到下一页"
msgstr "Open Cat and Sunset as shown in the [two-video walkthrough](usage.md) and advance one page"

msgid "两个标题仍在各自画面下，两路视频同时前进"
msgstr "Both clips advance while each title stays under its own video"

msgid "在发布页打开对应版本的 **Assets**。Windows 选 Windows 包，macOS 注意区分 Apple 芯片与 Intel，Linux 选择与处理器架构一致的包。如果该版本只提供 **Source code**，请使用下方的源码安装步骤。"
msgstr "Open **Assets** for the desired release. On Windows, choose the Windows bundle. On macOS, match Apple silicon or Intel. On Linux, match your processor architecture. If the release only lists **Source code**, use the source installation steps below."

msgid "解压并启动"
msgstr "Extract and launch"

msgid "[打开 GitHub Releases 下载软件](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/releases)。"
msgstr "[Download MulimgViewer from GitHub Releases](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/releases)."
